            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "I think you’re mixing different things (topics) together.\n\nPlease **create a fresh neovim config** without any unnecessary stuff.\na) `rm -rf ~/.local/share/nvim`\nb) `mv ~/.config/nvim ~/.config/nvim_old_bak`\n\n0. Do not setup anything: settings, kemaps etc.\n1. Install treesitter this way: with the svelte ..., afterwards check if everything is there (typescript etc)\nhttps://github.com/nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter/discussions/6618#discussioncomment-18038260\n2. install lspconfig with vim.pack\n3. enable svelte lspconfig\n4. Check if your problem persits\n5. try to disable lsp driven semantic-token highlighting and check the behavior (this caused some delays/problems for me in the past)\n\nI think Point 1) or 5) could be the problem.\n\n... 5) can be done with\n\n```lua\nlocal capabilities = vim.lsp.protocol.make_client_capabilities()\ncapabilities.textDocument.completion.semanticTokens = false\n\nvim.lsp.config('*', {\n    capabilities = capabilities,\n})\n```\n",
